{"text": "It would be difficult to describe the quiet brotherhood of men that grew up in that boat, for no one ever spoke of it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The captain, who could not row, gave orders in a soft voice, and the three men obeyed him more willingly than any crew had ever done. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The correspondent, who had been taught to doubt people, felt even then that this was the best experience of his life. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later the men raised the captains overcoat on an oar as a little sail, and the boat moved more easily toward the shore. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Someone found eight cigars, four of them still dry, and the men smoked them proudly and drank some fresh water. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon they could see the low, dark line of land, but there was no life saving station on the shore, and no boat came out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The surf was so rough that the captain decided they must row back out to sea and wait. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I am going to be drowned, the correspondent thought angrily, why was I allowed to come so far and see sand and trees.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "b", "e", " ", "d", "i", "f", "f", "i", "c", "u", "l", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "d", "e", "s", "c", "r", "i", "b", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", " ", "b", "r", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", "h", "o", "o", "d", " ", "o", "f", " ", "m", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "g", "r", "e", "w", " ", "u", "p", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "b", "o", "a", "t", ",", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "n", "o", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "s", "p", "o", "k", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "c", "a", "p", "t", "a", "i", "n", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "r", "o", "w", ",